            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>human & animal</dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>The interference with or prevention of a behavioral or verbal response even though the stimulus for that response is present; in psychoanalysis the unconscious restraining of an instinctual process.</dd>
                </span>
            
